# Wireframes — Real-time Issue Updates

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |
| `⟳` | Loading spinner | `●●●` | Skeleton placeholder |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |
| Live regions | ARIA live regions announce real-time updates |

---

## Screen Inventory

| Flow | Screen | States | Wireframe Section |
|------|--------|--------|-------------------|
| Issue List Updates | IssueListView | loading, populated, error | § Issue List View |
| Issue List Updates | IssueCard | populated, updated | § Issue Card |
| Issue Detail Updates | IssueDetailView | loading, populated, error, not-found | § Issue Detail View |
| Issue Detail Updates | CommentThread | loading, populated, empty | § Comment Thread |
| Issue Detail Updates | CommentCard | populated, edited | § Comment Card |
| Project List Updates | ProjectListView | loading, populated, error | § Project List View |
| Project List Updates | ProjectCard | populated, updated | § Project Card |
| Cycle List Updates | CycleListView | loading, populated, error | § Cycle List View |
| Cycle List Updates | CycleCard | populated, upcoming, active, completed | § Cycle Card |
| Notification Updates | NotificationBadge | loading, populated | § Notification Badge |
| Notification Updates | NotificationDropdown | loading, populated, empty | § Notification Dropdown |

---

## App Shell (Shared)

All screens sit within this shared frame.

**Grid**: 12-column / 8px spacing cadence. Max content width: 1280px.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Header — [Logo]  [Nav: Issues | Projects | Cycles]  [🔔N] [👤] |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Sidebar (optional)  |  Main Content Area                        |
|  +-----------------+ |  +--------------------------------------+ |
|  | Team Selector   | |  |  [h1] Screen Title                  | |
|  | Filter          | |  |                                      | |
|  | Views           | |  |  Content                             | |
|  +-----------------+ |  |                                      | |
|                      |  +--------------------------------------+ |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Header | Logo, primary nav, notification badge, user avatar | Sticky top, full width |
| Sidebar | Team selector, filters, saved views | Collapsible, 240px default |
| Main | Screen-specific content | Scrollable, padded 8px cadence |

---

## Issue List View

**Purpose & Flow Context**

Displays all issues for the team with real-time updates. Entry: navigate to /teams/:teamId/issues. Exit: click issue card or navigate away.

### Layout Regions

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Header — [Logo]  [Issues✓ | Projects | Cycles]  [🔔N] [👤]    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Sidebar       |  Main Content Area                              |
|  +-----------+ |  +--------------------------------------------+ |
|  | Team: ▼   | |  |  Issues                          [+ New]  | |
|  | Filters   | |  |  [ Search ________ ] [ Filter ▼ ] [ Sort ▼]| |
|  | > All     | |  +--------------------------------------------+ |
|  | > My      | |  |  ○ Backlog   ● Todo   ◐ In Progress   ✓ Done| |
|  | > Active  | |  |  +----------+ +----------+ +----------+ +--+| |
|  |           | |  |  | Issue    | | Issue    | | Issue    | |  || |
|  | Views     | |  |  | Card     | | Card     | | Card     | |  || |
|  | > Recent  | |  |  +----------+ +----------+ +----------+ +--+| |
|  +-----------+ |  +--------------------------------------------+ |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Team Selector | Dropdown | Switches team context, refreshes list | — |
| Search | Input (search) | Filters issues by title/description | Debounced 300ms |
| Filter | Dropdown | Filter by assignee, label, priority | Multi-select |
| Sort | Dropdown | Sort by created, updated, priority | — |
| New Issue | Button (primary) | Opens new issue modal | — |
| Status Columns | Card groups | Issues grouped by status | Drag to reorder |

### Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| "Issues" | Page heading | Team-scoped |
| "Search" | Placeholder | "Search issues..." |
| "+ New" | CTA | Create new issue |
| Status labels | Column headers | Backlog, Todo, In Progress, Done |

### States

#### Populated (Default)

Shows issues grouped by status in columns. Each column contains IssueCards.

#### Empty (No Issues)

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                     [Icon: Empty Box]                              |
|                     No issues yet                                  |
|                     Create your first issue to get started          |
|                     [+ Create Issue]                               |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

#### Empty (Filtered to Zero)

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                     [Icon: Search]                                 |
|                     No issues match your filters                   |
|                     Try adjusting your search or filters           |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

#### Loading

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [===== skeleton bar =====]   [==== skeleton ===]                |
|  +----------+ +----------+ +----------+ +----------+             |
|  | ●●●●●●●● | | ●●●●●●●● | | ●●●●●●●● | | ●●●●●●●● |             |
|  | ●●●●●●   | | ●●●●●●   | | ●●●●●●   | | ●●●●●●   |             |
|  | ●●●      | | ●●●      | | ●●●      | | ●●●      |             |
|  +----------+ +----------+ +----------+ +----------+             |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

Skeleton mirrors populated layout: 4 columns with 2-3 card placeholders each.

#### Error

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                     [Icon: Alert]                                  |
|                     Unable to load issues                          |
|                     Something went wrong loading your issues.      |
|                     [Retry]                                        |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full layout with sidebar and columns |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Sidebar collapses to icons, columns stack |
| Mobile (<768px) | Sidebar hidden, hamburger menu, single column list |

### Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | header, nav (sidebar), main |
| Heading order | h1 "Issues", h2 for status columns |
| Reading order | Sidebar → Search/filter bar → Status columns left to right |
| Keyboard | Tab through cards, Enter to open, Arrow keys between columns |
| Live region | Status announcements for real-time updates |

---

## Issue Card

**Purpose & Flow Context**

Individual issue card showing live status and assignee changes. Rendered within IssueListView columns.

### Anatomy

```
+------------------------------------------+
|  [Status Badge]  Issue Title              |
|  #123                                    |
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
|  | [Label] [Label]            [Avatar]  | |
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
|  Priority: [Icon]  Due: [Date]           |
+------------------------------------------+
```

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Status Badge | StatusBadge | Shows current status | Animated on change |
| Title | heading-3 | Click to open detail | Truncate at 2 lines |
| Identifier | caption | Issue number | — |
| Labels | Badge | Categorical labels | Max 3, overflow +N |
| Avatar | Avatar (small) | Assignee | Unassigned = empty |
| Priority | Icon | Priority level | — |
| Due Date | caption | Due date | Overdue = warning color |

### States

#### Populated (Default)

Card displays all fields as shown in anatomy.

#### Updated (Real-time)

Card briefly highlights with subtle flash when fields update in real-time. No layout jump.

### Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Issue title | Human-readable summary | Not a data model ID |
| #123 | Issue identifier | Prefixed with # |
| Labels | Categorical tags | User-defined |
| "Unassigned" | No assignee state | — |

### Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop | Full card layout |
| Tablet | Compact layout, hide priority |
| Mobile | Minimal card, tap to expand |

### Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | article role |
| Heading | h3 for card title |
| Keyboard | Tab to focus, Enter to open |
| Screen reader | "Issue #123: Title, Status, Assignee" |
| Live region | Announces field updates |

---

## Issue Detail View

**Purpose & Flow Context**

Displays full issue details with live comment updates. Entry: click issue card. Exit: navigate back to list.

### Layout Regions

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Header — [Logo]  [Issues✓ | Projects | Cycles]  [🔔N] [👤]    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [← Back to Issues]                                              |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Main Content Area                                               |
|  +--------------------------------------------+ +--------------+ |
|  |  Issue Title                     [Edit]    | | Details      | |
|  |  #123 — Status Badge             [Delete]  | | Status: ▼    | |
|  |                                            | | Assignee: ▼  | |
|  |  Description                                | | Priority: ▼  | |
|  |  Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet...              | | Labels: +    | |
|  |                                            | | Sprint: ▼    | |
|  |  +--------------------------------------+ | | Created:     | |
|  |  | 💬 Comments (3)                     | | | Updated:     | |
|  |  +--------------------------------------+ | +--------------+ |
|  |  | [Avatar] User Name     2 hours ago  | |                  |
|  |  | Comment body text...                | |                  |
|  |  +--------------------------------------+ |                  |
|  |  | [Avatar] User Name     1 hour ago   | |                  |
|  |  | Another comment...                  | |                  |
|  |  +--------------------------------------+ |                  |
|  |  | Add comment...                      | |                  |
|  |  | ________________________________    | |                  |
|  |  | [Submit]                            | |                  |
|  +--------------------------------------------+ +--------------+ |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Back link | Button (ghost) | Navigate to list | — |
| Title | heading-1 | Editable on click | — |
| Edit | Button (ghost) | Opens edit form | — |
| Delete | Button (danger) | Confirmation modal | — |
| Description | Body text | Markdown rendered | Expand if long |
| Comments | CommentThread | Real-time additions | — |
| Details sidebar | Card | Issue metadata | Collapsible |

### Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| "Back to Issues" | Navigation | Return to list |
| "Comments (N)" | Section heading with count | — |
| "Add comment..." | Placeholder | Input prompt |
| "Submit" | CTA | Post comment |

### States

#### Populated (Default)

Full issue details with comments displayed.

#### Empty (No Comments)

```
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
|  | 💬 Comments (0)                      | |
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
|  | No comments yet                       | |
|  | Be the first to comment                | |
|  |                                        | |
|  | Add comment...                        | |
|  | ________________________________      | |
|  | [Submit]                              | |
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
```

#### Loading

```
|  ●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●● |
|  ●●●●●●●●●●●●●                            |
|                                            |
|  ●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●● |
|  ●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●   |
|  ●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●              |
```

#### Error

```
|                                            |
|  [Icon: Alert]                             |
|  Unable to load issue                      |
|  This issue may have been deleted or you   |
|  don't have permission to view it.         |
|  [← Back to Issues]                        |
|                                            |
```

#### Not Found

```
|                                            |
|  [Icon: Question]                          |
|  Issue not found                           |
|  This issue doesn't exist or has been      |
|  removed.                                  |
|  [← Back to Issues]                        |
|                                            |
```

### Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Two-column: main + sidebar |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Sidebar collapses below main |
| Mobile (<768px) | Single column, sidebar as drawer |

### Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | main, aside (sidebar) |
| Heading | h1 for issue title, h2 for sections |
| Keyboard | Tab through fields, Enter to edit |
| Screen reader | "Issue #123: Title, Status: Todo, Assignee: John" |
| Live region | Announces new comments and field updates |

