## Comment Thread

**Purpose & Flow Context**

Chronological list of comments on an issue. Rendered within IssueDetailView.

### Anatomy

```
+------------------------------------------+
|  💬 Comments (3)                         |
+------------------------------------------+
|  [CommentCard]                           |
|  [CommentCard]                           |
|  [CommentCard]                           |
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
|  | Add comment...                       | |
|  | ________________________________     | |
|  | [Submit]                             | |
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
+------------------------------------------+
```

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Header | heading-2 | Comment count | — |
| CommentCard | Article | Individual comment | — |
| Input | Input (text) | New comment entry | Expand on focus |
| Submit | Button (primary) | Post comment | Disabled if empty |

### States

#### Empty

```
+------------------------------------------+
|  💬 Comments (0)                         |
+------------------------------------------+
|                                          |
|  No comments yet                         |
|  Start the discussion                    |
|                                          |
|  Add comment...                          |
|  ________________________________        |
|  [Submit]                                |
+------------------------------------------+
```

#### Loading

```
+------------------------------------------+
|  ●●●●●●●●●●●● (●)                        |
+------------------------------------------+
|  ●●●  ●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●          |
|  ●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●                   |
|                                          |
|  ●●●  ●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●          |
|  ●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●●                     |
+------------------------------------------+
```

#### Populated

Default state with comments listed chronologically.

### Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop | Full width thread |
| Mobile | Full width, compact cards |

### Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | section with aria-label "Comments" |
| Heading | h2 "Comments (N)" |
| Keyboard | Tab through comments and input |
| Live region | Announces new comments |

