## Comment Card

**Purpose & Flow Context**

Individual comment showing author, timestamp, and content.

### Anatomy

```
+------------------------------------------+
|  [Avatar]  User Name      2 hours ago    |
|            (edited)                      |
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
|  | Comment body text here...            | |
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
|  [Reply] [Edit] [Delete]                 |
+------------------------------------------+
```

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Avatar | Avatar (small) | Comment author | — |
| Author | body | User name | — |
| Timestamp | caption | Relative time | — |
| Edited | caption | Edit indicator | Only if edited |
| Content | Body text | Comment text | Markdown support |
| Actions | Button (ghost) | Reply, Edit, Delete | Only own comments |

### States

#### Populated (Default)

Standard comment display.

#### Edited

Same as default with "(edited)" indicator next to timestamp.

### Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop | Full layout |
| Mobile | Compact, actions as icon menu |

### Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | article |
| Keyboard | Tab to focus, Enter for actions |
| Screen reader | "Comment by User Name, 2 hours ago" |

