| Icon | Icon | Project icon | Default if none |
| Title | heading-3 | Project name | Truncate |
| Description | caption | Brief summary | 2 lines max |
| Progress | Progress bar | Completion % | — |
| Stats | caption | Issue count, members, due date | — |

### States

#### Populated (Default)

Standard project display.

#### Updated (Real-time)

Brief highlight when project fields update.

### Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
