| Desktop | Full card |
| Mobile | Compact, hide description |

### Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | article |
| Heading | h3 for project name |
| Keyboard | Tab to focus, Enter to open |
