## Cycle Card

**Purpose & Flow Context**

Individual cycle card showing cycle status, date range, and progress.

### Anatomy

```
+------------------------------------------+
|  [Status Badge] Cycle Title               |
|  Jan 1 – Jan 15, 2025                    |
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
|  | Issues: 8  Completed: 5  [====] 63%  | |
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
+------------------------------------------+
```

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Status Badge | StatusBadge | Cycle state | Animated on change |
| Title | heading-3 | Cycle name | — |
| Date Range | caption | Start – End | — |
| Stats | caption | Issue count, completed, progress | — |
| Progress | Progress bar | Completion % | — |

### States

#### Populated (Default)

Standard cycle display with appropriate status badge.

#### Upcoming

Status badge shows "Upcoming". No progress bar.

#### Active

Status badge shows "Active" with animation. Progress bar shows current %.

#### Completed

Status badge shows "Completed". Progress bar at 100%.

### Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop | Full card |
| Mobile | Compact, hide progress |

### Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | article |
| Heading | h3 for cycle name |
| Keyboard | Tab to focus, Enter to open |
| Screen reader | "Cycle: Title, Active, 63% complete" |

