## Notification Badge

**Purpose & Flow Context**

Header badge showing unread notification count. Rendered in App Shell header.

### Anatomy

```
+-----------+
|  Count    |
+-----------+
```

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Container | Badge (count) | Positioned on bell icon | — |
| Count | span | Numeric count | 99+ for overflow |

### States

#### Loading

Hidden or shows spinner.

#### Populated (Zero)

Hidden — no badge visible.

#### Populated (Positive)

Red background with white count text. Increments on new event.

#### Overflow

Shows "99+" for counts above 99.

### Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| All | Consistent 16px badge |

### Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Screen reader | "N unread notifications" on bell icon |
| Live region | Announces count changes |

