## Notification Dropdown

**Purpose & Flow Context**

Dropdown list of recent notifications. Entry: click notification badge. Exit: click outside or press Escape.

### Layout Regions

```
+------------------------------------------+
|  Notifications                    [Mark all read] |
+------------------------------------------+
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
|  | [Avatar] New comment on #123         | |
|  |           2 minutes ago              | |
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
|  | [Avatar] Issue #456 assigned to you  | |
|  |           1 hour ago                 | |
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
|  | [Avatar] Cycle "Sprint 5" activated | |
|  |           3 hours ago                | |
|  +--------------------------------------+ |
+------------------------------------------+
```

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Header | heading-3 | "Notifications" | — |
| Mark all read | Button (ghost) | Marks all as read | — |
| Notification items | Card (compact) | Click to navigate | Unread = highlighted |
| Avatar | Avatar (small) | Notification actor | — |
| Content | body | Notification text | — |
| Timestamp | caption | Relative time | — |

